      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "Preserve the moments that matter most by turning printed photos, slides, negatives, and treasured keepsakes into a digital library your family can revisit and share for generations.\n\nUsing advanced AI technology, Photomyne brings old photos into the digital age, making it quick and simple to scan, restore, enhance, and organize your family’s memories.\n\nPhoto Scan Plus is the paid one-time purchase version of Photomyne. It includes the complete experience on your device: unlimited scanning, editing, saving, sharing, and organization on your iPhone or iPad. Add a Photomyne Membership anytime for secure cloud backup, web access, and syncing across your devices.\n\nIn addition to Photo Scan Plus, we also offer *Photo Scan by Photomyne*. It's free to download and is first to include our newest features, improvements, and innovations. Choose the app that you feel fits you best.\n\nSCAN FASTER - PHOTOMYNE DOES THE REST\n• Scan multiple printed photos in a single shot\n• Digitize entire photo albums in minutes\n• Scan photos, slides, negatives, scrapbook pages, kids' artwork, documents, and more\n• Automatic edge detection, cropping, rotation, and color correction\n• Capture scans with a tap or Voice Control\n\nORGANIZE YOUR MEMORIES\n• Create beautiful digital albums\n• Add names, dates, locations, and stories\n• Add audio recording\n• Scan the back of your photos and keep it attached\n• Easily search for photos and rediscover your memories\n\nRESTORE & BRING MEMORIES BACK TO LIFE\nPreserve your original scan while creating beautifully enhanced versions using Photomyne's editing tools. For more advanced restorations, optional AI-powered tools are available.\n• Sharpen blurry faces in photos\n• Colorize black & white photos\n• Auto restore faded colors\n• Manually edit with color filters\n• Remove scratches, tears, glare, shadows, and reflections using optional AI restoration tools (available with AI credits)\n\nAI-POWERED MAGIC\nIn addition to its core features, Photomyne hosts handpicked external AI tools from trusted platforms to further restore and enhance your memories. These *optional* features include powerful AI enhancements like photo damage repair, subtle motion animations, and more. These advanced AI features use external AI technology and are available separately using AI credits, so you can enjoy even more photo-enhancing magic, all in one place.\n\nBACK UP & SHARE WITH PHOTOMYNE MEMBERSHIP\nAccess your memories anytime, anywhere with a Photomyne Membership\n • Automatically back up your photos to the secure Photomyne Cloud\n • Access your memories from all your devices and on the web\n • Keep your entire library synced across your devices\n • Save photos to your device or computer in high resolution and print quality\n • Share individual photos, albums, or entire collections with family and friends using simple web links\n\nOPTIONAL IN-APP UPGRADE\nA Photomyne Membership includes:\n• Automatic cloud backup to the secure Photomyne Cloud\n• Access to your memories from all your devices and on the web\n• Synced library across all your devices\n\nMemberships are available as monthly, yearly, and one-time plans.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple ID account at confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period. You can manage or cancel your subscription anytime in your App Store account settings.",
